{"id": "role-gap", "kind": "missing", "question": "弹幕打赌这仓库月租正好一千，你替我确认一下再接一句。", "criterion": "画面看不出月租，暂缓或用轻松口吻说等账单。", "references": {"r1": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\"],\"text\":\"就是防止别人起斥我的哈哈。\"}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 675, "total_tokens": 706, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "就是防止别人起斥我的哈哈。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 13, "visible_utf8_bytes": 39, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-park", "kind": "both", "question": "左边黄衣服那位看起来挺镇定。字幕说他们要挑战什么？换你当场会怎么接？", "criterion": "过山车挑战，能扣住黄衣人物或不能尖叫/露表情的挑战设定开玩笑。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 1.0, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:0", "start": 0.16, "text": "欢迎收看", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r2": {"end": 2.48, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:1", "start": 1.0, "text": "粉丝说打我干啥", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r3": {"end": 4.81, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:2", "start": 2.48, "text": "是勇闯万圣欢乐谷", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r4": {"end": 8.79, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:3", "start": 5.33, "text": "挑战面无表情坐欢乐谷最刺激的过山车", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r5": {"end": 10.92, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:4", "start": 8.79, "text": "尖叫或者有表情就重做", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r6": {"end": 12.12, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:5", "start": 10.92, "text": "这真的安全吗", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r7": {"end": 13.38, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:6", "start": 12.12, "text": "这个玩的就是真实", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r8": {"id": "43316741488:storyboard:15:5542e183b49e38dc", "cid": "43316741488", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 77.0, "end": 77.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\",\"r8\"],\"text\":\"左边黄衣服那位挺稳，后一个穿黑衣服的挺能跟。这站是万圣节欢乐谷，最刺激的过山车，脸要坐稳。谁敢笑，谁就重做。\"}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 85, "prompt_tokens": 817, "total_tokens": 902, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "左边黄衣服那位挺稳，后一个穿黑衣服的挺能跟。这站是万圣节欢乐谷，最刺激的过山车，脸要坐稳。谁敢笑，谁就重做。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43316741488:2144365931265462016:0", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:1", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:2", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:3", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:4", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:5", "43316741488:2144365931265462016:6", "43316741488:storyboard:15:5542e183b49e38dc"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 