{"id": "role-shop", "kind": "both", "question": "这个创业比喻也太敢说了，鱼鱼，你看着背后那排箱子会怎么接一句？", "criterion": "搭讪比喻和后方蓝色箱子都入答，可以对箱子或比喻玩梗。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 2.18, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:0", "start": 0.1, "text": "其实创业跟搭讪一样啊", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r2": {"end": 3.12, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:1", "start": 2.18, "text": "是概率学", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r3": {"end": 5.1, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:2", "start": 3.12, "text": "只要你不断的去创", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r4": {"end": 6.24, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:3", "start": 5.1, "text": "去搭讪", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r5": {"end": 7.82, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:4", "start": 6.24, "text": "就是会成功哇", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r6": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\"],\"text\":\"就是防别人起讪我的哈哈。鱼鱼，这行话像把箱子塞进口袋，箱子自己装不下。\"}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 66, "prompt_tokens": 773, "total_tokens": 839, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 309}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "就是防别人起讪我的哈哈。鱼鱼，这行话像把箱子塞进口袋，箱子自己装不下。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43183702202:2140978995461008384:0", "43183702202:2140978995461008384:1", "43183702202:2140978995461008384:2", "43183702202:2140978995461008384:3", "43183702202:2140978995461008384:4", "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 35, "visible_utf8_bytes": 105, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-oil", "kind": "both", "question": "这位顶着瓶子出场，我差点喷了。货架换的是什么油？你给这位起个外号接梗。", "criterion": "交代字幕的氢化植物油和图里的油瓶或 CANOLA，外号接住油瓶造型，不把瓶身写成氢化油。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 11.85, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:5", "start": 8.67, "text": "整个西方世界莫名掀起了一股戒油运动", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r2": {"end": 12.92, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:6", "start": 11.85, "text": "他们把猪油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r3": {"end": 13.52, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:7", "start": 12.92, "text": "牛油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r4": {"end": 16.06, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:8", "start": 13.52, "text": "奶油等动物性油脂赶下了货架", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r5": {"end": 19.6, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:9", "start": 16.06, "text": "而重新在架上摆上了号称健康的氢化植物油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r6": {"end": 21.98, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:10", "start": 19.6, "text": "与标榜低脂的饼干与牛奶", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r7": {"id": "43297409051:storyboard:334:85c1a7b1c209557d", "cid": "43297409051", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1671.0, "end": 1671.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\"],\"text\":\"瓶身还写着CANOLA，他手一抬，油瓶就晃了。货架换的，不是普通油，是跟健康饼干、牛奶一起的。\"}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 76, "prompt_tokens": 823, "total_tokens": 899, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 309}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "瓶身还写着CANOLA，他手一抬，油瓶就晃了。货架换的，不是普通油，是跟健康饼干、牛奶一起的。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43297409051:2143820935726738432:5", "43297409051:2143820935726738432:6", "43297409051:2143820935726738432:7", "43297409051:2143820935726738432:8", "43297409051:2143820935726738432:9", "43297409051:2143820935726738432:10", "43297409051:storyboard:334:85c1a7b1c209557d"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 47, "visible_utf8_bytes": 129, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
